{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c8f2d3e4-5b6a-4f7c-8d9e-2b3c4d5e6f70",
    "name": "Story Spark AI — Frontend Routes",
    "description": "## Frontend → Backend API Collection\n\nEvery REST endpoint the **React frontend** (`frontend/`) consumes, grouped exactly by the modules it imports. Import this into Postman and run the auth chain first.\n\n### Frontend Env Vars\n| Var | Used For |\n|---|---|\n| `VITE_BASE_URL` | REST API base (`http://localhost:5000/api/v1`) |\n| `VITE_SOCKET_URL` | Socket.IO server (notifications + collab) |\n| `VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` | Google OAuth login |\n\n### Auth Header\nThe axios instance (`frontend/src/helpers/axios/axionInstance.ts`) sends the **raw access token** — no `Bearer ` prefix:\n```\nAuthorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\n```\nThis collection does the same.\n\n### Run Order\n1. **OTP Validation → Verify Email** (get OTP in mail)\n2. **OTP Validation → Verify OTP** → saves `{{verification_token}}`\n3. **Auth → Register** or **Auth → Login** → saves `{{access_token}}`\n4. Everything else runs in any order.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_path", "value": "/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "verification_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_email", "value": "demo@storyspark.ai", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_password", "value": "Spark@1234", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_name", "value": "Demo Writer", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "post_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "author_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "comment_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "story_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth (Login · Register · OAuth)",
      "description": "Powers the Login / Signup pages and `frontend/src/services/auth.service.ts` (stores the JWT in localStorage).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (Signup page)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"name\": \"{{test_name}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"{{test_password}}\",\n  \"verificationToken\": \"{{verification_token}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Signup page submit. Password: 8+ chars with upper, lower, number, special."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const j = pm.response.json();",
            "if (j?.data?.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.data.accessToken);"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Login page)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Login page submit → `accessToken` saved to collection, mirrors `storeUserInfo()`."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const j = pm.response.json();",
            "if (j?.data?.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.data.accessToken);"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Google Login (OAuth button)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<google-id-token>\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/google-login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "google-login"] },
            "description": "Continue-with-Google button exchanges the Google ID token for a session."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password (Forgot page)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "forgot-password"] },
            "description": "Forgot-password page — emails an OTP."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password (Forgot page step 2)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"NewSpark@1234\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"NewSpark@1234\",\n  \"verificationToken\": \"{{verification_token}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "reset-password"] },
            "description": "Second step of forgot-password with the OTP-derived verification token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password (Settings)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"oldPassword\": \"{{test_password}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewSpark@1234\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/change-password", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "change-password"] },
            "description": "Change password from account settings. Auth required."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token (silent re-auth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{access_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/auth/refresh-token", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "auth", "refresh-token"] },
            "description": "Rotate access token when the JWT expires."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "OTP Validation (Signup email verify)",
      "description": "The signup flow verifies the email with an OTP before registering.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verify Email (send OTP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"name\": \"{{test_name}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/otp_validation/verify-email", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "otp_validation", "verify-email"] },
            "description": "Signup step 1 — OTP lands in the mailbox."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_path}}/otp_validation/verify-otp", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["{{api_path}}", "otp_validation", "verify-otp"] },
            "description": "Signup step 2 — saves `{{verification_token}}` for the register call."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const j = pm.response.json();",
            "const d = j?.data || {};",
            "const t = d.verificationToken || d.verification_token || d.token;",
            "if (t) pm.collectionVariables.set('verification_token', t);"
          ] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
